      <link>https://www.third-derivative.org/portfolio/mitti-labs</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="hs-featured-image-wrapper"&gt; 
 &lt;a href="https://www.third-derivative.org/portfolio/mitti-labs" title="" class="hs-featured-image-link"&gt; &lt;img src="https://www.third-derivative.org/hubfs/mittilabs_web.png" alt="Mitti Labs" class="hs-featured-image" style="width:auto !important; max-width:50%; float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;"&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;h5&gt;PROBLEM FOCUS&lt;/h5&gt; 
&lt;div&gt; 
 &lt;span&gt;Globally, rice farming is a major source of methane emissions. Yet farmers lack incentives and tools to adopt climate-smart practices. Mitti Labs enables low-methane rice cultivation by supporting farmers with advisory services and generating verified carbon credits through digital MRV.&lt;/span&gt; 
